        "Content": "Entrance hallway - 5.04m (16'6\") x 2m (6'7\")\nParquet flooring. Closet.\n\nTV room - 3.07m (10'1\") x 3.04m (10'0\")\nSolid wood flooring. Feature fireplace.\n\nSitting room. - 4.03m (13'3\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nSolid wood flooring. Feature fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 6.02m (19'9\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nTiled flooring. Floor and eye level presses. Oil fired Stanley cooker. Patio doors to rear.\n\nUtility - 3.08m (10'1\") x 3.01m (9'11\")\nFully plumbed. Tiled flooring. Presses. \nWC and whb off.\nHotpress\n\nMain Lounge - 7.06m (23'2\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nSolid wooden flooring. Fireplace & oil fired stove. Coving\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 3.06m (10'0\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wooden flooring. Whb\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 2.05m (6'9\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wooden flooring. Whb\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.08m (13'5\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nMaster bedroom. Solid wooden flooring. Walk in wardrobes.\nEnsuite with shower.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 3.07m (10'1\")\nDouble bedroom. Solid wooden flooring. Whb.\n\nBathroom - 2.03m (6'8\") x 2m (6'7\")\nFully fitted.\n\nLarge garage 30 X 15 ft\n\nFlower shed\n\nFreezer shed 4.8 X 2.8\n\nGarage 4.8 X 4.1\n\nWorkshop 4.8 X 2.8\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
